title: "Cumulus: introduce authority discovery for parachains"

doc:
  - audience: Node Dev
    description: |
      Adds authority discovery support for parachains to keep all parachain
      collators connected to each other as reserved peers on the block-announce
      protocol. This makes block propagation between collators more reliable
      under churn.

      Enabling this on a parachain requires adding `pallet-authority-discovery`
      (and `pallet-session` to feed it) to the runtime and exposing
      `AuthorityDiscoveryApi` and setting up the authority discovery keys.

crates:
  - name: cumulus-client-collator-discovery
    bump: patch
  - name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
    bump: major
  - name: sc-network-sync
    bump: major
  - name: polkadot-sdk
    bump: minor
